 www2027.thewebconf.org/\nVenue Radar: https://gon-uri.github.io/venue-rad
 ar/#www-2027\nNotes: Full-paper abstract and paper deadlines (Oct 18/25 A
 oE) have passed with no extension. The short-paper OpenReview portal was 
 observed open on 2026-10-30\; separate mandatory abstract gates apply. Re
 source papers (four pages\, non-anonymous\, companion proceedings) are du
 e Dec 17 AoE\; their portal is not public yet. OpenReview's short-paper f
 orms close about an hour after the AoE cutoffs stored here. Demo papers (
 Nov 16 per the website)\, the PhD symposium (Jan 6 per the website) and t
 he general workshop-paper date (Jan 4\, workshops not yet listed) are not
  tracked as separate routes\; the OpenReview demo and PhD symposium forms
  are set to close Nov 15\, 21:00 UTC. The Web4Good track is discontinued.
  Research must substantively address the Web\, not merely use a web datas
 et. Preserve WWW as the stable series alias. Size is an editorial estimat
 e.
